WEBVTT

00:06:27.587 --> 00:06:31.043
(Explosion) ("Sure") (Laughter)

00:06:31.043 --> 00:06:32.970
RL: I think he's a great American.

00:06:32.970 --> 00:06:36.751
(Laughter)

00:06:36.751 --> 00:06:40.054
So, "Titanic" was, if you don't know the story,

00:06:40.054 --> 00:06:41.794
doesn't end well.

00:06:41.794 --> 00:06:44.575
(Laughter)

00:06:44.575 --> 00:06:47.726
Jim Cameron actually photographed the real Titanic.

00:06:47.726 --> 00:06:50.007
So he basically set up, or basically shattered

00:06:50.007 --> 00:06:52.410
the suspension of disbelief, because what he photographed

00:06:52.410 --> 00:06:55.837
was the real thing, a Mir sub going down, or actually

00:06:55.837 --> 00:06:58.180
two Mir subs going down to the real wreck,

00:06:58.180 --> 00:07:00.217
and he created this very haunting footage.